# The fixed part of the package description: `make package-args` writes
# release/package.args from it and src/settings.def (a --setting line per row);
# `make test` fails when that file is out of date.
#
# Bridge 1.5, the oldest NBT Manager runs, with `status` only (README,
# "Status"): the menu label. Not `show`: the manager would hand the
# application its surface, which the daemon does not use (it places its own),
# and stop it when nothing appeared there.
--app
android-auto
--compat
nbt_6.5_armv7
--bridge
1.5
--bridge-uses=
--bridge-optional
status
